            <div xml:id="d61">

                <pb facs="0072" n="60" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg60"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.248/612a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Afghanistan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Thayer</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-06-26T22:00:00-04:00">June 26, 1942—10
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6. The Department fully approves of New Delhi’s suggestion that you express to
                    the Afghan Government the regret of this Government that an American army plane
                    inadvertently flew over Afghan territory.</p>
                <p>Please keep the Department fully informed of developments.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
